(7441012, 1176826, 60495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, love everything about this one especially the lighting. well done!</td>', 'Beautiful image, love everything about this one especially the lighting. well done!', '2016-03-04 18:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441013, 1176837, 60495, '<td valign="top">The windmill is great but with such an overall dark image the bright lights become a real distraction, to bad you could not find an angle where they would be a little more hidden. Also not sure I like the subject so centered but I do like the subject itself and the way the sky back lit the blades works nicely.</td>', 'The windmill is great but with such an overall dark image the bright lights become a real distraction, to bad you could not find an angle where they would be a little more hidden. Also not sure I like the subject so centered but I do like the subject itself and the way the sky back lit the blades works nicely.', '2016-03-04 18:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441014, 1176884, 60495, '<td valign="top">Just does not work for me personally, it is way to cluttered and no real focal point. It may appeal to others but basically not my cup of tea.</td>', 'Just does not work for me personally, it is way to cluttered and no real focal point. It may appeal to others but basically not my cup of tea.', '2016-03-04 18:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
