(7441316, 1176833, 156466, '<td valign="top">great capture. shame you have that one twig/vine across the top of the head (birds will do that to you)</td>', 'great capture. shame you have that one twig/vine across the top of the head (birds will do that to you)', '2016-03-06 14:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441318, 1176133, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great face - makes the shot</td>', 'Great face - makes the shot', '2016-03-06 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441325, 1176569, 156466, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot. I''m seeing dark halos around the rocks which I find very distracting, almost as if you tried to heal sharpening halos and went too far outside the rocks(?).  The water also feels flat, like it''s lacking texture or variation in color.  Well captured, but I''m not thrilled with the post. 6</td>', 'Powerful shot. I''m seeing dark halos around the rocks which I find very distracting, almost as if you tried to heal sharpening halos and went too far outside the rocks(?).  The water also feels flat, like it''s lacking texture or variation in color.  Well captured, but I''m not thrilled with the post. 6', '2016-03-06 14:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441329, 1176839, 156466, '<td valign="top">With the visible leash I prefer this one unrotated.</td>', 'With the visible leash I prefer this one unrotated.', '2016-03-06 14:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441333, 1176699, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract lines. Perhaps a little shadow-heavy on the upper-left building - I would have liked to see the lines between the window panes a little more clearly.</td>', 'Nice abstract lines. Perhaps a little shadow-heavy on the upper-left building - I would have liked to see the lines between the window panes a little more clearly.', '2016-03-06 14:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441338, 1176800, 156466, '<td valign="top">The water and hills are wonderful, but oh, those halos.  The haloing almost makes it look like you''ve substituted a different sky, even though you didn''t. Easily fixed.  I''m struggling with some of the foreground elements, particularly the center of the bottom edge.  I suspect you could have removed them without risking DQ.</td>', 'The water and hills are wonderful, but oh, those halos.  The haloing almost makes it look like you''ve substituted a different sky, even though you didn''t. Easily fixed.  I''m struggling with some of the foreground elements, particularly the center of the bottom edge.  I suspect you could have removed them without risking DQ.', '2016-03-06 14:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441339, 1176395, 156466, '<td valign="top">You always insist on shooting something like this when I actually have something doing well in a FS, don''t you Rob? ;)</td>', 'You always insist on shooting something like this when I actually have something doing well in a FS, don''t you Rob? ;)', '2016-03-06 14:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441343, 1176806, 156466, '<td valign="top">Cutting board skew distracts from an otherwise really nice still life.</td>', 'Cutting board skew distracts from an otherwise really nice still life.', '2016-03-06 14:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7441348, 1176446, 156466, '<td valign="top">In my top 5.  Would be top 3 but it feels like it needs just a tiny bit of "pop". I like the subtle feel but I lose the center of the tree.</td>', 'In my top 5.  Would be top 3 but it feels like it needs just a tiny bit of "pop". I like the subtle feel but I lose the center of the tree.', '2016-03-06 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
