(7443605, 1175746, 59737, '<td valign="top">What a sweet image, she''s a beauty and her connection with the camera in this photo is great.  Love the processing and the bokeh.</td>', 'What a sweet image, she''s a beauty and her connection with the camera in this photo is great.  Love the processing and the bokeh.', '2016-03-11 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7443607, 1176689, 59737, '<td valign="top">Striking image, this has a very strong graphic nature, like the color contrast of the red with the darkness of the figure.  The long exposure looks really nice, gives the image a motion that it would otherwise lack.  The seam on the floor provides a nice leading line into the picture.</td>', 'Striking image, this has a very strong graphic nature, like the color contrast of the red with the darkness of the figure.  The long exposure looks really nice, gives the image a motion that it would otherwise lack.  The seam on the floor provides a nice leading line into the picture.', '2016-03-11 15:26:38.000000', NULL, 0),
