(7444698, 1176588, 113591, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> I love that flower blooming floor<br/> <br/>I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1077279" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/50695/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1077279.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Gave it 9 because of that.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: I love that flower blooming floor I''m hanging this in my fantasy art gallery    Gave it 9 because of that.', '2016-03-16 10:22:04.000000', NULL, 0),
